{"seq":2,"slug":"imitation-learning","title":"模仿学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/embodied-ai/robot-learning/imitation-learning","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"模仿学习\">模仿学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模仿学习（Imitation Learning, IL）是当前机器人学习最实用的范式之一。其核心思想是让机器人通过观察人类示范学习技能，而不是从零探索。相比强化学习需要大量试错，模仿学习的样本效率高出几个数量级——几十到几百个示范就可能学到有用的技能。本节系统讲解模仿学习的三大主流路线：行为克隆（Behavior Cloning, BC）、逆强化学习（Inverse RL, IRL）、Diffusion Policy。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[模仿学习方法] --&gt; B[行为克隆 BC]&#10;    A --&gt; C[逆强化学习 IRL]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Diffusion Policy]&#10;    A --&gt; E[ACT / VLA 类]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[最简单&lt;br/&gt;分布漂移]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[学习奖励函数&lt;br/&gt;计算复杂]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;多模态分布]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[Transformer&lt;br/&gt;多任务]\">graph TD\n    A[模仿学习方法] --&gt; B[行为克隆 BC]\n    A --&gt; C[逆强化学习 IRL]\n    A --&gt; D[Diffusion Policy]\n    A --&gt; E[ACT / VLA 类]\n    B --&gt; B1[最简单&lt;br/&gt;分布漂移]\n    C --&gt; C1[学习奖励函数&lt;br/&gt;计算复杂]\n    D --&gt; D1[扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;多模态分布]\n    E --&gt; E1[Transformer&lt;br/&gt;多任务]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为克隆 (BC)</td>\n<td>监督学习模仿示范动作</td>\n<td>简单、快速</td>\n<td>分布漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAgger</td>\n<td>BC + 在线纠错</td>\n<td>缓解分布漂移</td>\n<td>需在线交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆强化学习 (IRL)</td>\n<td>从示范学习奖励函数再 RL</td>\n<td>泛化能力强</td>\n<td>计算复杂、不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diffusion Policy</td>\n<td>扩散模型生成动作分布</td>\n<td>处理多模态、表达丰富</td>\n<td>推理慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACT</td>\n<td>Transformer + Action Chunking</td>\n<td>长时序稳定</td>\n<td>需要大量示范</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"行为克隆-最简单也最常用\">行为克隆：最简单也最常用</h2><p>行为克隆（BC）是模仿学习的基础形式：把示范数据视为监督学习的训练集，输入是观察 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，输出是示范动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最小化预测动作与示范动作的差距：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{BC} = \\mathbb{E}_{(o,a) \\sim D} [||\\pi_\\theta(o) - a||^2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>BC 的优势是简单、训练快、不需要在线交互。在很多场景下，几百到几千个高质量示范配合 BC 就能让机器人学到有用的技能。这是 ALOHA、Mobile ALOHA、Diffusion Policy 等近年工作的基础。</p>\n<p>但 BC 有一个致命弱点——分布漂移（distribution shift）。训练时智能体看到的是示范中的状态分布；部署时一旦它做了一个错误动作，就会进入示范中没出现过的状态，从此越走越偏。这种累积误差让 BC 在长时序任务上经常失败。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[BC 训练] --&gt; B[示范状态分布]&#10;    B --&gt; C[策略学习]&#10;    C --&gt; D[部署: 状态偏离]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更多偏离]&#10;    E --&gt; F[完全失败]&#10;    G[DAgger 改进] --&gt; H[在线收集失败状态]&#10;    H --&gt; I[专家标注]&#10;    I --&gt; J[加入训练集]&#10;    J --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[BC 训练] --&gt; B[示范状态分布]\n    B --&gt; C[策略学习]\n    C --&gt; D[部署: 状态偏离]\n    D --&gt; E[更多偏离]\n    E --&gt; F[完全失败]\n    G[DAgger 改进] --&gt; H[在线收集失败状态]\n    H --&gt; I[专家标注]\n    I --&gt; J[加入训练集]\n    J --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"dagger-缓解分布漂移\">DAgger：缓解分布漂移</h2><p>DAgger（Dataset Aggregation）是 BC 的重要改进——通过在线交互收集失败状态，再让专家（人类或最优策略）标注这些状态的正确动作，加入训练集。具体流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用初始示范训练 BC 策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在环境中执行，收集状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>让专家对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 标注正确动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9357em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>加入数据集，重新训练得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>重复 2-4</li>\n</ol>\n<p>DAgger 在数学上有强收敛保证（与最优策略的差距以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 增长，N 为时间步数）。但实践中很少直接使用 DAgger 原版——人类专家在线标注的成本极高。常用的折衷是 HG-DAgger（Human-Gated DAgger）——只在策略明显犯错时让人类介入纠正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆强化学习-从示范学习奖励函数\">逆强化学习：从示范学习奖励函数</h2><p>逆强化学习（IRL）的核心思想：与其直接模仿动作，不如反推示范背后的奖励函数，然后用 RL 在该奖励上训练。这种方法的吸引力在于——奖励函数比策略更&quot;基本&quot;，可能在新环境下泛化更好。</p>\n<p>经典 IRL 算法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Linear IRL（Ng &amp; Russell, 2000）</strong>：假设奖励是状态特征的线性组合，求解使示范最优的权重。</li>\n<li><strong>Maximum Entropy IRL（Ziebart, 2008）</strong>：用最大熵原理处理示范的次优性，奖励函数推断更鲁棒。</li>\n<li><strong>GAIL（Generative Adversarial Imitation Learning）</strong>：用 GAN 框架，判别器区分示范与策略动作，生成器学习&quot;骗过&quot;判别器的策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>IRL 在理论上优雅但在实践中较少落地，主要原因是计算复杂（IRL 内部嵌套着 RL，每次更新奖励都要重新解 RL）、不稳定（GAN 训练的常见问题）、且对示范数据要求高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"diffusion-policy-当前主流路线\">Diffusion Policy：当前主流路线</h2><p>Diffusion Policy（CMU 与 MIT 的合作工作，2023）是当前模仿学习最成功的范式之一。其核心创新是用扩散模型生成动作分布，而不是单一动作预测。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[观察 o] --&gt; B[扩散模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C[噪声 z_T]&#10;    C --&gt; D[逐步去噪]&#10;    D --&gt; E[动作序列 a_0:T]&#10;    F[训练] --&gt; G[在示范上训练扩散过程]&#10;    G --&gt; H[去噪网络学习真实动作分布]\">graph LR\n    A[观察 o] --&gt; B[扩散模型]\n    B --&gt; C[噪声 z_T]\n    C --&gt; D[逐步去噪]\n    D --&gt; E[动作序列 a_0:T]\n    F[训练] --&gt; G[在示范上训练扩散过程]\n    G --&gt; H[去噪网络学习真实动作分布]</pre><p>Diffusion Policy 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多模态建模</strong>：扩散模型天然处理多模态分布（同一状态下示范者可能有多种合理动作），不会被均值化掉。</li>\n<li><strong>动作序列生成</strong>：一次生成未来 T 步动作（action chunking），减少推理频率，提升稳定性。</li>\n<li><strong>泛化能力</strong>：扩散模型在视觉等领域已被证明强大的生成能力，迁移到动作生成同样有效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Diffusion Policy 的劣势是推理较慢（需要多步去噪），不太适合高频控制场景。改进方法包括 Consistency Policy、Flow Matching Policy 等加速去噪过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"act-与-action-chunking\">ACT 与 Action Chunking</h2><p>ACT（Action Chunking with Transformers，斯坦福，2023）是另一类成功的模仿学习方法。它的核心思想是把动作预测从&quot;单步动作&quot;改为&quot;未来动作序列&quot;——一次预测未来 K 步动作（典型 K=10-100），降低分布漂移与推理频率。</p>\n<p>ACT 用 Transformer 架构编码观察序列，解码器输出未来 K 步动作。配合 ALOHA 这类高质量遥操作系统采集的数据，ACT 在双臂操作任务上取得了惊人的效果。Mobile ALOHA 进一步把 ACT 扩展到全身动作。</p>\n<p>ACT 与 Diffusion Policy 在某种意义上代表了两条相似哲学的不同实现——都强调动作序列而非单步动作、都用强大的网络架构（Transformer / Diffusion）建模复杂分布。两者在不同任务上各有所长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据采集-模仿学习的瓶颈\">数据采集：模仿学习的瓶颈</h2><p>模仿学习的最大瓶颈不是算法而是数据。高质量示范从哪来？常见来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>遥操作（Teleoperation）</strong>：人类通过 VR 设备、跟踪手套或专门的遥操作主臂（ALOHA、GELLO）控制机器人，机器人记录关节角度作为示范。</li>\n<li><strong>动作捕捉（Mocap）</strong>：穿戴传感器或视觉跟踪系统记录人类动作，再迁移到机器人。</li>\n<li><strong>视频学习</strong>：从 YouTube 等视频中学习人类动作，需要克服视角差异、形态差异等问题。</li>\n<li><strong>跨形态迁移</strong>：用其他机器人的数据初始化，再适应当前机器人。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数据规模的工程经验：单任务通常需要 50-200 个高质量示范；多任务需要每个任务 20-50 个；通用基础模型需要数十万到数百万示范。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模仿学习是机器人学习当前最实用的范式，从 BC、DAgger、IRL 到 Diffusion Policy、ACT，方法不断演进。当前最高效的工程组合是&quot;高质量遥操作数据 + Diffusion Policy 或 ACT + 少量 RL 微调&quot;。把模仿学习作为大多数具身任务的默认方法、把 RL 作为补充优化手段，是当前主流的工程哲学。理解模仿学习方法谱系能让研究者根据数据质量、任务复杂度、推理频率约束选择合适的方法，避免为了用 RL 而放弃了更高效的模仿路线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模仿学习","id":"模仿学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行为克隆：最简单也最常用","id":"行为克隆-最简单也最常用"},{"level":2,"text":"DAgger：缓解分布漂移","id":"dagger-缓解分布漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"逆强化学习：从示范学习奖励函数","id":"逆强化学习-从示范学习奖励函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Diffusion Policy：当前主流路线","id":"diffusion-policy-当前主流路线"},{"level":2,"text":"ACT 与 Action Chunking","id":"act-与-action-chunking"},{"level":2,"text":"数据采集：模仿学习的瓶颈","id":"数据采集-模仿学习的瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器人领域的强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/embodied-ai/robot-learning/reinforcement-learning-robotics"},"next":{"title":"机器人基础模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/embodied-ai/robot-learning/foundation-models-for-robots"}}